DP on transactions: buy[i] and sell[i] per day. O(kn) for k transactions.

For max profit with cooldown I will track two state variables per day.

```python
def max_profit_k(k, prices):
    if not prices: return 0
    n = len(prices)
    if k >= n // 2:
        return sum(max(0, prices[i] - prices[i-1]) for i in range(1, n))
    buy = [-float('inf')] * (k + 1)
    sell = [0] * (k + 1)
    for p in prices:
        for j in range(1, k + 1):
            buy[j] = max(buy[j], sell[j-1] - p)
            sell[j] = max(sell[j], buy[j] + p)
    return sell[k]
