Top-down DP with memoization. Cache computed results; fib(n) = fib(n-1) + fib(n-2).

```python
def fib(n, memo={}):
    if n in memo:
        return memo[n]
    if n < 2:
        return n
    memo[n] = fib(n - 1, memo) + fib(n - 2, memo)
    return memo[n]
